From ccc9f10dfdc6082713bfc6743a6f586c25f07839 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 10:15:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Quieten the empty state for social links and the info note

Three dashed placeholder tiles on a place with nothing registered made
the card look unfinished and put big tap targets in front of people with
nothing to contribute.

Now:
- nothing registered  -> no grid; one sentence and a text link
- something registered -> only the real tiles, plus a small "+" tile
- "+" with several platforms left opens a picker inside the sheet;
  with one left it goes straight to the input

A sentence reads as "if you happen to know this", where a "+" button
reads as "press me", so the invitation stays discoverable without
collecting curiosity taps. The note block follows the same pattern.
